DESCRIPTION:Come join us in the DRA Library Atrium for a <b><u>FREE</u></b>
  NFC card!<br><br>Everyone is welcome\, regardless of skill\, technical ba
 ckground\, or student status!<br><ul><li>Learn: Come learn how to program 
 your NFC card to link to your socials\, resume\, or any other URL!</li><li
 >Chat: Discuss how NFC works\, its real world applications\, and other ner
 dy topics!</li></ul><br>We will be using <i>NFC Tools</i> (free version) 
 for this event\, which is available on both Android and iOS mobile devices
 . Feel free to get it yourself or have one of us demonstrate it for you! Y
 ou can find the Google Play\, APK\, and App Store links here:<br><ul><li><
 b>Google Play (Android):</b> <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/
