 b> and will include a mix of discussion and hands-on activities around AI
 .<br><br>Participants will explore:<ul><li>The biggest benefits and opport
 unities associated with AI</li><li>What people need in order to trust AI</
 li><li>Key trust issues and concerns\, and how these could be addressed</l
 i><li>A hands-on VR experience</li><li>Continued AI agent building and tes
 ting</li></ul><br>There will also be <strong><b><u>FREE</u></b></strong> f
 ood provided at the event for participants! <br><br>For participants look
 ing for something more technical\, there will also be an <b>optional advan
 ced activity</b> for those who want to go a little deeper and push their 
 AI skills further.<br><br>This event is hosted by one of the DATA club's p
 artners: Mark Mc Kenzie!
